msgstr "选择背景类型"

#: ui.py:91
msgid "3. Trace a cutout to speed up renders"
msgstr "描摹抠图以加快渲染"

#: nodes.py:48
msgid "Add the image on top of whatever is behind it. Best for fire, sparks, smoke and light effects shot on black"
msgstr "将图像叠加在其后方内容之上。最适合在黑色背景上拍摄的火焰、火花、烟雾和光效"

